{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0124_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d968b4bce2cf7b6e6deb3aae701d01190770d7989f72827a0aac1180bfbda3d5", "ja": "（ドラマの撮影は、今日で無事クランクアップ。\n莉緒はエルフ役をよく演じ切ってくれた！）", "zh": "（电视剧的拍摄，顺利在今天杀青了。\n莉绪完美诠释了精灵一角！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0124_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "94f6fcb2f2750c70056233f291763a26063985a11ca790e1aafcc5556e6906eb", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}くん。\n衣装を着替える前に……ちょっとだけ外に出てもいい？", "zh": "欸，{$P$}。\n换下服装之前……我可以出去外面一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0124_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "d8455f974aff6494e1278572395de2a8f7b0c3d7d3464400bfe94a21249e1c35", "ja": "すこし、外の空気を吸いたいの。\nほらほら、{$P$}くんも行きましょ♪", "zh": "我想呼吸一些外面的空气。\n来来来，{$P$}也一起到外面吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0124_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4498d48591f2d8d156c79d1980a822a74b08e1f108468ce54976f7aa5eb1824a", "ja": "えっ？　あ、莉緒！\n勝手に外に出ちゃ……。", "zh": "咦？啊、莉绪！\n不可以随便出去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0124_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "9a2e2a3ef9b33311202d118cd8a433db9bc446a02d980b3121598862433c47e9", "ja": "んー！　晴れててよかったわね～。星がキレイ！\n見て見て、{$P$}くん♪", "zh": "嗯～！好在天气晴朗～星星好美！\n你看你看，{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0124_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f9bc6f768d78ba7909c8fb42c0723e8763cc36880bace432f75b8f8199a14b51", "ja": "許可はもらったけど……あまり遠くに行かないで\nくれよ、莉緒。衣装を見られると困るからな。", "zh": "虽然取得同意了……但是你可不要跑太远喔，莉绪，\n被人看到服装会很伤脑筋的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0124_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "f3c41ea4bb0b11f21f2a827cab37b060dc0268f0ccf7b5c971e76c6c55c0100a", "ja": "わかってるわよ～、もう。\nでも、ワガママに付き合ってくれてありがとね。", "zh": "我知道啦～真是的。\n不过，谢谢你配合我的任性要求。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0124_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "ee1dabbcf34026ab1e0ac71506d4ff578737bc60858e4f512fcc5bab3ce0fb8d", "ja": "クランクアップした～！って思ったら、\nなんだかホッとして気が抜けちゃったんだもん。", "zh": "一想到杀青了，\n我就松了一口气，整个人松懈下来了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0124_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "da95dd9f5473b7959be16fe113309ccd90249c8cdb16b796c240418c53d90642", "ja": "でも、お仕事の現場ですもの。他の人たちに、\n気の抜けた顔を見られるわけにはいかないから……ね？", "zh": "可是这里是工作现场，\n总不能让其他人看到我松懈的表情……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0124_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6e288ac03751fdc5a79cd1e0e69ec1d02a8cbf9544090e0e53809c95524ffc95", "ja": "ホッとして……\n莉緒、そんなに緊張してたのか？", "zh": "松一口气……\n莉绪，原来你那么紧张啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0124_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "beb83f12a2a7bda38d61560c0b739d9f9ad7214b8f790938d300e6da25227691", "ja": "当然じゃない！　だって、エルフ役なんて初めてだし。\n私なりに、いろいろ試行錯誤してたんだから。", "zh": "那还用说！因为我是第一次演精灵啊，\n我自己也是做了很多摸索尝试的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0124_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "0091ce659f5d0d100bb04336c07f7ceee3235652ae25bde36ef9854c39d1ac17", "ja": "何より……\nエルフのセクシーさを、どう表現するべきかって！", "zh": "特别是……\n该怎么表现出精灵的性感魅力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0124_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ff4be182f4ed633fd307612fe1994b6ae119c827cba5629768c5e2c465a6be03", "ja": "そうだったのか……\nって、エルフのセクシーさ？", "zh": "原来是这样……\n呃，精灵的性感魅力？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0124_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "a47ccea258d6904c1ecf887ac13f63cd90469c7c8a884aeb1a94c309393019a9", "ja": "え？　だって、大事なことでしょ？\nどう？　エルフらしい妖艶さ、滲み出てたかしら？", "zh": "咦？这可是重点中的重点，不是吗？\n如何？有没有流露出精灵的妖艳气息？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0124_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ab011f8aaf59e9b5846822bb97d5c33e12b06395b022f7aa95a4d1a2ad3b218c", "ja": "う、うーん……。エルフらしくはあったけど、\nセクシーという感じではなかったような……。", "zh": "唔、嗯……是很像精灵没错，\n但好像没什么性感的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0124_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "96e239d99548d39707cc6f9dda55d22201f52e7ac0f299caff3fc2b789518dda", "ja": "え～っ！？　脚線美アピールはちゃんとした\nつもりなのに、あれでも足りなかったなんて……。", "zh": "咦～！？我明明有强调腿部的曲线美啊，\n那样竟然还不够……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0124_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "5b52cd995a0072e273beefdd81cf4fc91620341a96a345ba4e32c855f5412aa1", "ja": "今から、監督に自主リテイクお願いしようかしら？\n妖艶でセクシーな要素をふんだんに盛り込んで……。", "zh": "不如现在主动拜托导演重拍好了？\n然后大量加入妖艳又性感的要素……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0124_1017_p", "source_sha256": "adf50e9252ddf43a4d47a692d789129bbdc19eacce8716719c03457b66d690f8", "ja": "いや、そうじゃなくて。セクシーより、\n神秘的な美しさという感じだったかなって。", "zh": "不是啦，我的意思是，\n与其说是性感，更像是一种神秘的美感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0124_1018_p", "source_sha256": "17de0d3dc5f30e5c0dfcf25219147ca8140a330b2d9993790ae20a200127a954", "ja": "莉緒のエルフは綺麗だったよ。\n本当に、別の世界に迷い込んだみたいだった。", "zh": "莉绪扮演的精灵很美丽，\n简直就像不小心踏进了另一个世界似的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0124_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "7bdc09e9b5279213a71bcb5faf3a95fd1cb057f8f50eac8e2af0b35ded0e010d", "ja": "えっ……や、やだ、{$P$}くんたら。\n綺麗で神秘的な、別世界の存在だなんて……♪", "zh": "咦……讨、讨厌啦，{$P$}。\n说什么美丽又神秘、像是其他世界才有的人物……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0124_1020_p", "source_sha256": "136843197675c995e788421dc54c026c04f4000397738a5feccbae2dddbad260", "ja": "莉緒？", "zh": "莉绪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0124_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "52239562bcb117dd1f6278de3e90b4111ce4b21e2e177abaaa8853a4b115f5fc", "ja": "もしかして私、{$P$}くんを\n魅了しちゃったのかしら？　なんて。ウフッ♪", "zh": "我该不会把{$P$}给迷住了吧？\n开玩笑的，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0124_1022_046rio", "source_sha256": "1d41c99b5dd5f1cbff19bae72b3ef1bd0131e241f3744f473dec6c65e854f85a", "ja": "まかせて！　{$P$}くんのことは、\nこれからも私が、別世界に連れていってあげるから！", "zh": "包在我身上！今后我也会继续带{$P$}\n前往其他世界的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0124_1023_p", "source_sha256": "60a8dab190a78d7e19553342faddb5fc2142e629a40d3bee271d34b8fbcbf8fb", "ja": "（エルフ役、気に入ったのかな……これからも、\n莉緒の色んな魅力を引き出していけるといいな！）", "zh": "（莉绪似乎很喜欢精灵这个角色……\n希望今后也能继续激发出她的各种魅力！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
